OL,5,G2305 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,6,     FIn Cambridgeshire, the heli-medics
OL,7,     Frace to treat a cyclist with a
OL,8,     Ftime-critical brain injury. On the
OL,9,     FNorfolk Broads, Tom breaks his
OL,10,     Fthigh bone jumping off a boat.
OL,11,G0010 Emergency Helicopter Medics
OL,12,     FHeli-medics race to a skydiver
OL,13,     Fwho's suffered serious injuries
OL,14,     Fafter crashing into a house. And
OL,15,     Fthere's a race across the country
OL,16,     Fto reach a man who's fallen 40
OL,17,     Ffeet from a ladder.
