OL,5,G0115 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FOn a busy Saturday night in A&E at
OL,7,     FKing's College Hospital, staff
OL,8,     Fmust juggle the needs of elderly
OL,9,     Fpatients and sick children with
OL,10,     Fpatients who are drunk or violent.
OL,11,G0215 24 Hours in A&E
